{"mangaRefs":["file-518-522"],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"en":"Heiji tells Conan that he met a better detective than Conan during middle school and reminisces about the case three years ago. At Yamagata Zao Onsen Ski Resort, an actor named Shohei Minowa is murdered in the same fashion as his old stunt performer, Jiro Mizugami, who was murdered four years ago at the same resort. Minowa is killed while on a ski lift and the gun is placed in his hand suggesting suicide. Minowa's bag is filled with snow to suggest that a Yuki-onna murdered him.","zhHans":"围绕水无怜奈、CIA、FBI和组织行动展开的长期情报战。","zhHant":"","legacy":true,"sourcePage":"Heiji_Hattori_vs._Shinichi_Kudo__Deduction_Battle_on_the_Ski_Slope!","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-ran-mouri","character-heiji-hattori","character-conan-edogawa","character-shinichi-kudo","character-heizo-hattori","character-sonoko-suzuki","character-yukiko-kudo","character-kazuha-toyama","character-yusaku-kudo"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime","src-detective-conan-world-bo-timeline","src-detective-conan-world-cia"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 50~51","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":489,"dcwMangaSource":"V50 - F8 ~ V51 - F1(518-522)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"December 3, 2007"},"season":12,"solvedByRaw":"Shinichi Kudo","solvedBy":"character-shinichi-kudo","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Shinichi Kudo","Heiji Hattori","Ran Mouri","Kazuha Toyama","Shizuka Hattori","Yukiko Kudo","Yusaku Kudo","Heizo Hattori","Sonoko Suzuki","Kazuha's friend"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"Heiji_Hattori_vs._Shinichi_Kudo__Deduction_Battle_on_the_Ski_Slope!"}}